  "prefLabel": "Int 209.13 Ex Parte Communications",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Int 209.13 Ex Parte Communications. Unless required for the disposition of ex parte matters authorized by law, no board member, party, intervener or party representative, shall communicate, directly or indirectly, in connection with any issue before the board, with any party or person, except upon notice and opportunity for all parties to participate.\n\nSource. #10040-A, eff 12-16-11 (from Int 210.19); ss by #10359, eff 6-14-13",
